  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Apparently. A new version of Oculus Rift is coming called Oculus Rift S, which has higher-resolution, better lenses, halo strap, and Oculus Insight tracking (Or inside-out tracking if you prefer) with five sensors. (Instead of four for Oculus Quest) And since Facebook said that when they release the new version of Rift, all the content that works for the original rift is going to work on that next version too.\n\nSo I was wondering if VRChat might get Oculus Rift S support in the future since it's a good little upgrade for Oculus Rift.",
